WEBVTT

00:22:57.093 --> 00:23:00.514
CA: Give me an example of two leaders
that people might have heard of

00:23:00.538 --> 00:23:02.934
that sort of -- if you like,
stereotypes --

00:23:02.958 --> 00:23:05.074
for those two different
types of leadership.

00:23:05.098 --> 00:23:06.446
SC: Oh, sure. OK.

00:23:06.470 --> 00:23:10.063
Well, Bill Gates is a great example
of an introverted leader,

00:23:10.087 --> 00:23:12.014
and he's talked about this

00:23:12.038 --> 00:23:15.434
and about how, when he's faced
with a difficult problem,

00:23:15.458 --> 00:23:18.863
his impulse is to go off
and read about it for three days.

00:23:18.887 --> 00:23:21.927
And you can see what
the downside of that might be,

00:23:21.951 --> 00:23:27.368
that people need the person
to actually be there, engaging with them.

00:23:27.392 --> 00:23:30.325
And the upside is that problems
are really complex,